  /// 128 Unicode characters in length and can't be prefixed with aws: or rds:
  /// . The string can only contain the set of Unicode letters, digits,
  /// white-space, '_', '.', '/', '=', '+', '-' (Java regex:
  /// "^([\\p{L}\\p{Z}\\p{N}_.:/=+\\-]*)$").
